<title>PORTUGAL: Lisnave restructuring plan set for Feb.</title>
<headline>Lisnave restructuring plan set for Feb.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>A plan to restructure loss-making Portuguese state-owned ship repairer Lisnave-Estaleiros Navais de Lisboa is expected to be ready next month, the cabinet said.</p>
<p>&quot;The process should be concluded in February,&quot; a statement issued after the regular weekly cabinet meeting said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
